.TH TYPES 5
.SH NAME
types \- system type declarations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B "#include <sys/types.h>"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Various system calls (e.g. stat(2)) return system information in variables of specific types. For portability purposes, these types are all declared in the include file <sys/types.h> and are given below:
.nf
typedef unsigned int daddr_t;   /* disk address */
typedef char *       caddr_t;   /* core address */
typedef int          ino_t;     /* i-node number */
typedef long         time_t;    /* a time */
typedef int          dev_t;     /* device code */
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
stat(2)
.sp
